1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Fourth Episode
The Phantom Ship

15
00:02:30,741 --> 00:02:35,019
Prince, no! It's dangerous!
Don't do it! You'll get hurt!

16
00:02:35,061 --> 00:02:37,017
Bye! Bye!

17
00:02:37,661 --> 00:02:40,016
Good heavens, Prince Sapphire!

18
00:02:40,061 --> 00:02:43,610
You must not do these things!
Wait! You'll break your neck!

19
00:02:46,101 --> 00:02:47,693
Here I am!

20
00:02:48,821 --> 00:02:50,221
Are you OK?

21
00:02:52,061 --> 00:02:54,370
- Well...!
- I've got you, finally!

22
00:02:54,421 --> 00:02:58,995
Today a ball will be held on a ship!
Go and change your clothes immediately!

23
00:02:59,021 --> 00:03:02,285
No! You know that if there's one thing
I detest, it's dancing!

24
00:03:26,501 --> 00:03:28,173
Listen!

25
00:03:28,221 --> 00:03:29,791
Ladies and gentlemen,

26
00:03:29,816 --> 00:03:33,098
I inform you that Prince Franz Charming
of Goldland has arrived among us privately!

27
00:03:35,187 --> 00:03:36,292
This is a surprise!

28
00:03:52,421 --> 00:03:55,493
Is this how you enjoy welcoming
a guest in these parts?

29
00:03:56,401 --> 00:03:58,063
Now I'm going to have some fun!

30
00:04:10,461 --> 00:04:13,578
Nice to meet you,
Prince Sapphire! I am Franz.

31
00:04:14,501 --> 00:04:17,196
The pleasure is mine.

32
00:04:17,221 --> 00:04:18,935
Go ahead and start dancing,
Prince Franz.

33
00:04:19,901 --> 00:04:22,665
I don't like dancing.
I will watch you.

34
00:04:22,907 --> 00:04:24,011
And let's postpone the pleasantries
until later!

35
00:04:24,421 --> 00:04:26,412
Prince Sapphire!

36
00:04:33,941 --> 00:04:37,101
I especially like watching
the dancers! I'll see you from up here!

37
00:04:37,747 --> 00:04:41,895
Sapphire is a nice boy,
but I think he's teasing me.

38
00:04:50,021 --> 00:04:50,738
Wait for me!

39
00:05:00,181 --> 00:05:02,331
Boys, behave! Stop it!

40
00:05:05,100 --> 00:05:06,581
Baron Nylon,
stop playing around!

41
00:05:06,621 --> 00:05:07,955
You know why we are here.

42
00:05:07,979 --> 00:05:10,409
Don't worry, Grand Duke.

43
00:05:10,433 --> 00:05:13,021
Very soon we will verify
that Sapphire is a girl,

44
00:05:13,061 --> 00:05:16,178
even if she behaves
like a tomboy. I have an idea!

45
00:05:17,301 --> 00:05:20,498
Look, in the meantime, how they are
tying up those two brats!

46
00:05:20,541 --> 00:05:23,374
Exactly! My idea is to
involve Prince Frank...

47
00:05:23,421 --> 00:05:25,810
...in the dilemma and have
him investigate in our place.

48
00:05:25,861 --> 00:05:28,871
Yes, that's not a bad idea.

49
00:05:38,153 --> 00:05:40,296
Where is he going? Let's wait and see...

50
00:05:44,701 --> 00:05:46,259
Thank you.

51
00:05:49,501 --> 00:05:52,413
Baron Nylon, what did you
want to tell me that is so secret?

52
00:05:52,461 --> 00:05:55,373
I wanted to make you aware
of something very important.

53
00:05:55,397 --> 00:05:57,771
You see, the matter
concerns Prince Sapphire.

54
00:05:57,821 --> 00:06:00,335
No one knows whether
he is a boy or a girl.

55
00:06:00,381 --> 00:06:02,611
Therefore, I thought
of turning to you.

56
00:06:02,661 --> 00:06:05,459
Your Highness, help me discover
the secret of Prince Sapphire!

57
00:06:05,501 --> 00:06:06,667
Please! Please!

58
00:06:06,691 --> 00:06:08,209
It is not known if it is
a boy or a girl?

59
00:06:09,340 --> 00:06:11,621
Really interesting!
Alright, I accept!

60
00:06:14,580 --> 00:06:16,150
Sapphire! Be careful!

61
00:06:17,146 --> 00:06:18,891
Baron Nylon is plotting
to discover your secret!

62
00:06:19,500 --> 00:06:23,460
Oh, bon appétit, Sapphire! But I
see that you certainly don't lack that!

63
00:06:23,500 --> 00:06:26,060
You know, someone told
me that you have a peculiarity.

64
00:06:26,100 --> 00:06:28,692
Nylon told him too.

65
00:06:31,712 --> 00:06:32,585
Help!

66
00:06:34,580 --> 00:06:38,795
Where did I fall? I am
near the rowers' benches!

67
00:06:45,340 --> 00:06:49,493
Come on! Row!
Come on, wimps!

68
00:06:49,517 --> 00:06:52,180
Don't be sissies!

69
00:07:06,340 --> 00:07:09,617
What?!
I'll show you, lazybones!

70
00:07:12,780 --> 00:07:15,773
No one dares defy the whip.

71
00:07:19,860 --> 00:07:23,695
Morning and night, always rowing.

72
00:07:23,740 --> 00:07:27,017
Harder! Row, you slackers!

73
00:07:34,820 --> 00:07:39,895
Poor souls! I wonder why they work
chained up like that..! Really strange!

74
00:07:40,180 --> 00:07:43,730
Morning and night, always rowing.

75
00:07:43,780 --> 00:07:47,694
Come on, lazybones! If you
don't row, I won't feed you!

76
00:07:48,500 --> 00:07:50,571
Damn it, I'm so thirsty!

77
00:07:52,180 --> 00:07:53,289
What a strange mouse!

78
00:07:53,313 --> 00:07:55,014
Did you say I'm a mouse?!

79
00:07:55,039 --> 00:07:57,814
No! For your information,
I am an angel!

80
00:07:58,020 --> 00:08:00,899
Hey, are you serious?
Don't tell me you're a real angel!

81
00:08:00,940 --> 00:08:04,900
Yes! And you are chained up because
you did something bad, right?

82
00:08:04,940 --> 00:08:06,499
What are you talking about?

83
00:08:06,540 --> 00:08:09,965
Hey, you, down there!
What are you grumbling about? Row!

84
00:08:14,420 --> 00:08:16,218
Stop the ship!

85
00:08:16,260 --> 00:08:18,411
Did you hear? Now stop!

86
00:08:23,306 --> 00:08:26,689
Now I'm retiring to eat!
Don't make the slightest noise!

87
00:08:26,740 --> 00:08:29,653
Excuse me, what did you do
to end up inside this ship?

88
00:08:29,700 --> 00:08:31,817
Guys,
this little one is an angel.

89
00:08:31,860 --> 00:08:34,295
We have to tell him the truth
about what brought us here.

90
00:08:34,420 --> 00:08:37,215
- And you will judge...
- ...if we deserved...

91
00:08:37,260 --> 00:08:39,013
...to lead this life!

92
00:08:39,060 --> 00:08:41,097
Yeah, we didn't do
anything wrong.

93
00:08:41,300 --> 00:08:43,417
We refused to bow.

94
00:08:44,581 --> 00:08:48,620
We refused to bow at the
passage of Grand Duke Duralumin,

95
00:08:48,861 --> 00:08:51,898
so the soldiers chained us up
and brought us here.

96
00:08:52,221 --> 00:08:54,291
Row! Full speed ahead!

97
00:08:54,341 --> 00:08:56,354
Come on, get moving!
Start rowing again!

98
00:08:56,847 --> 00:08:58,330
Let's start singing again, too!

99
00:08:58,574 --> 00:09:03,452
Morning and night, always rowing.

100
00:09:03,501 --> 00:09:09,736
No one will burn us anymore.

101
00:09:11,181 --> 00:09:15,304
Well, I am an angel
and I must help these poor souls.

102
00:09:21,181 --> 00:09:23,900
Listen, Franz, I don't like
dancing or singing!

103
00:09:23,941 --> 00:09:26,522
But you must dance,
when you are invited!

104
00:09:27,501 --> 00:09:29,017
Where are you, Sapphire? Where are you?

105
00:09:34,221 --> 00:09:36,068
Excuse me, Sapphire! Listen!

106
00:09:36,092 --> 00:09:38,180
What is it, Tink? What do you want?

107
00:09:38,221 --> 00:09:39,515
I have to tell you something important.

108
00:09:39,539 --> 00:09:41,099
So, what is it?

109
00:09:41,141 --> 00:09:43,018
Well, you see...

110
00:09:43,061 --> 00:09:45,655
Stop singing!

111
00:09:46,380 --> 00:09:47,621
May I? Yes?

112
00:09:51,701 --> 00:09:54,932
Excellent! And now...

113
00:09:58,661 --> 00:10:00,940
He has more important
things to do, than dancing!

114
00:10:01,701 --> 00:10:05,011
Morning and night, always rowing.

115
00:10:05,621 --> 00:10:07,577
Be quiet!

116
00:10:07,621 --> 00:10:09,418
That's enough!

117
00:10:15,061 --> 00:10:16,090
Princess Sapphire!

118
00:10:16,115 --> 00:10:17,701
Princess Sapphire?!

119
00:10:20,674 --> 00:10:21,771
I am not a girl!

120
00:10:23,541 --> 00:10:25,532
You shouldn't hide it from me.

121
00:10:25,581 --> 00:10:27,290
Shut up! How dare you?!

122
00:10:29,021 --> 00:10:31,455
From the way you
dance you seem like a girl.

123
00:10:31,501 --> 00:10:32,736
I forbid you to say these things!

124
00:10:34,741 --> 00:10:35,880
Do you want to fight?

125
00:10:35,904 --> 00:10:37,917
No! You know, I hate fighting!

126
00:10:37,941 --> 00:10:40,375
Then you were the real girl all along!

127
00:10:40,421 --> 00:10:42,097
What are you saying?
Me, a girl?

128
00:10:42,121 --> 00:10:43,075
We'll see about that! En garde!

129
00:10:43,099 --> 00:10:44,522
En garde yourself!

130
00:10:45,881 --> 00:10:49,138
Sapphire, I don't think
this is the right time to fight!

131
00:10:53,101 --> 00:10:55,017
You're worse than a boy!

132
00:10:56,221 --> 00:10:57,542
You're strong for a girl!

133
00:10:57,566 --> 00:10:59,338
When will you understand that I'm a boy?!

134
00:10:59,381 --> 00:11:01,611
Now I'll make you understand it clearly!

135
00:11:01,661 --> 00:11:04,016
Come on, you two! Stop it!

136
00:11:04,061 --> 00:11:05,261
Leave us alone! Get out of here!

137
00:11:07,501 --> 00:11:11,016
Sapphire's voice is becoming
more and more like a girl's.

138
00:11:11,061 --> 00:11:12,813
Don't you think so too?

139
00:11:12,861 --> 00:11:15,580
Yes, yes! Yes!
Keep going, you two!

140
00:11:15,621 --> 00:11:17,373
Well done! Well done! Have fun!

141
00:11:21,621 --> 00:11:24,340
What an effort to break these chains!

142
00:11:24,381 --> 00:11:27,020
Thank you, angel! I will
never forget your kindness!

143
00:11:37,707 --> 00:11:39,010
Enough, friends! Let's rebel!

144
00:11:39,035 --> 00:11:40,229
From now on, we won't row anymore!

145
00:11:41,579 --> 00:11:44,173
What?! Damn it!

146
00:11:44,400 --> 00:11:46,001
Hey, you!
What did you do with the chains?

147
00:11:49,101 --> 00:11:50,819
Let's go!

148
00:11:50,861 --> 00:11:54,251
- Let's go above deck!
- We are free!

149
00:11:54,927 --> 00:11:56,690
I think I've made
a mess!

150
00:11:57,914 --> 00:11:59,594
I'll beat you!

151
00:11:59,618 --> 00:12:00,650
It won't be easy!

152
00:12:06,894 --> 00:12:07,954
We can make our move!

153
00:12:17,021 --> 00:12:19,581
Watch out, Sapphire!
It's a mutiny! Get down!

154
00:12:21,701 --> 00:12:23,121
What are you going to do?

155
00:12:23,145 --> 00:12:24,135
You'll see!

156
00:12:25,101 --> 00:12:27,556
Why are you so violent?
Stop it!

157
00:12:27,581 --> 00:12:30,015
Shut up, brat,
or you'll see how you end up!

158
00:12:30,061 --> 00:12:31,938
Oh, no! Don't do it!

159
00:12:34,181 --> 00:12:37,173
Sapphire, it's dangerous to stay
on deck! Let's take shelter elsewhere!

160
00:12:37,221 --> 00:12:38,341
No! I want to stay!

161
00:12:56,861 --> 00:12:59,180
Help! Help! I can't swim!

162
00:13:01,261 --> 00:13:01,823
Forward!

163
00:13:04,221 --> 00:13:05,444
Watch out, they are soldiers

164
00:13:05,787 --> 00:13:06,454
Damn it!

165
00:13:06,479 --> 00:13:07,118
Stop!

166
00:13:10,141 --> 00:13:12,780
Let's retreat! To the control room!

167
00:13:14,261 --> 00:13:15,853
Get them!

168
00:13:15,901 --> 00:13:18,341
Quick, boys! Let's set
a trap! Open the hull!

169
00:13:19,034 --> 00:13:22,019
Open up or it will be worse for you!

170
00:13:32,741 --> 00:13:34,459
All set!

171
00:13:47,021 --> 00:13:49,012
Not the sea!

172
00:13:53,087 --> 00:13:54,657
Lets go ashore!

173
00:14:07,541 --> 00:14:09,896
Damn it! There were other soldiers!

174
00:14:10,061 --> 00:14:13,212
Stupid slaves! You will pay dearly
for your rebellion!

175
00:14:13,901 --> 00:14:16,893
Listen, Princess, why don't
we stop and shake hands?

176
00:14:16,941 --> 00:14:19,819
I'm not a princess! Get
that through your head!

177
00:14:20,381 --> 00:14:23,817
Let's not talk about it anymore! Instead, I
wonder how we are going to get out of here.

178
00:14:24,021 --> 00:14:27,297
Sapphire, up on deck
they are fighting furiously!

179
00:14:27,341 --> 00:14:29,218
The prisoners are in revolt!

180
00:14:39,501 --> 00:14:44,177
Wait! They are not to blame! You shouldn't
have chained them up for so little!

181
00:14:44,221 --> 00:14:47,770
Where did you come from, Your Highness? I
thought they had thrown you into the sea too!

182
00:14:47,821 --> 00:14:50,415
As for these rebels,
I know what they deserve!

183
00:14:50,461 --> 00:14:51,886
Don't hurt them!

184
00:14:51,911 --> 00:14:53,180
They are good people!

185
00:14:53,221 --> 00:14:55,576
They only refused
to bow!

186
00:14:55,601 --> 00:14:56,480
Who are you?

187
00:14:56,504 --> 00:14:58,010
A friend of... Help!

188
00:15:10,421 --> 00:15:12,439
Nylon, proceed
with the execution of the rebels!

189
00:15:13,381 --> 00:15:14,462
Commander, proceed!

190
00:15:14,487 --> 00:15:15,747
Let the execution begin!

191
00:15:24,021 --> 00:15:25,818
But this sound is..!

192
00:15:25,861 --> 00:15:28,295
These drums announce
the execution of a sentence!

193
00:15:28,341 --> 00:15:29,224
Yes, it's true.

194
00:15:29,248 --> 00:15:31,304
Why is it that you don't want to keep your promise?

195
00:15:31,781 --> 00:15:35,376
What promise? I don't remember
making any promise.

196
00:15:35,421 --> 00:15:37,282
I only know that those rebels
deserve death.

197
00:15:37,741 --> 00:15:41,211
I will tell my father that Grand Duke
Duralumin is a big liar!

198
00:15:41,301 --> 00:15:43,815
Go ahead and tell him!
Here is the Decree with his seal

199
00:15:43,861 --> 00:15:44,851
...authorizing the execution.

200
00:15:46,621 --> 00:15:49,294
Call the people!
Let them witness the execution!

201
00:15:49,341 --> 00:15:51,218
I want it to serve as an example!

202
00:15:51,261 --> 00:15:53,411
That Grand Duke is really wicked!

203
00:16:06,821 --> 00:16:09,210
The only way is to try
a surprise action!

204
00:16:10,334 --> 00:16:10,825
Hello!

205
00:16:10,849 --> 00:16:12,264
Prince Franz?!

206
00:16:12,581 --> 00:16:14,412
I followed you
because I cannot allow.

207
00:16:14,461 --> 00:16:16,452
...that a girl ends up
getting into trouble!

208
00:16:16,501 --> 00:16:18,731
Listen: I already told
you that I'm not a girl!

209
00:16:18,781 --> 00:16:21,036
Now shut up! Leave it to me!
Don't worry!

210
00:16:21,061 --> 00:16:22,357
I can do
everything you do!

211
00:16:23,421 --> 00:16:26,244
You know you're cute and I
really like that little face of yours?

212
00:16:47,254 --> 00:16:48,619
What the hell is it?!

213
00:16:48,661 --> 00:16:50,350
Don't worry, it's just me!

214
00:16:57,049 --> 00:16:58,360
Don't you have anything to say?

215
00:17:00,821 --> 00:17:04,177
Grand Duke Duralumin,
we are proud to die!

216
00:17:04,221 --> 00:17:07,372
We are proud of not
having bowed before you!

217
00:17:07,421 --> 00:17:09,571
You deserve nothing but contempt!

218
00:17:09,621 --> 00:17:12,533
Ready with the plank!
Pull it away!

219
00:17:15,021 --> 00:17:16,818
What the hell is going on?

220
00:17:19,581 --> 00:17:21,333
There's no one here!

221
00:17:21,421 --> 00:17:25,096
No one?! Don't talk nonsense!
The cannon doesn't fire on its own!

222
00:17:25,141 --> 00:17:27,894
Search! Search the whole ship!

223
00:17:27,940 --> 00:17:29,741
Search for the traitor
lurking among us!

224
00:17:41,030 --> 00:17:41,590
What?

225
00:17:41,730 --> 00:17:42,270
I don't know!

226
00:17:42,474 --> 00:17:44,430
If you've got nothing to do, find the intruder!

227
00:17:45,341 --> 00:17:47,332
What are you doing here?

228
00:17:52,501 --> 00:17:54,219
They saved me!

229
00:17:57,581 --> 00:17:59,856
Help! This ship is haunted!

230
00:18:02,141 --> 00:18:03,733
Are you having fun?

231
00:18:03,757 --> 00:18:04,291
No.

232
00:18:04,341 --> 00:18:07,538
Find the traitors! Search
from top to bottom!

233
00:18:08,741 --> 00:18:10,732
Damn! What's happening?

234
00:18:21,581 --> 00:18:23,572
Something is wrong!

235
00:18:30,101 --> 00:18:32,376
The ship is moving, Grand Duke!

236
00:18:32,421 --> 00:18:33,661
How can it be moving!

237
00:18:37,447 --> 00:18:39,654
Stop the ship immediately!
Don't let it head out to sea!

238
00:18:39,701 --> 00:18:41,419
Stop it in the harbor!

239
00:18:49,661 --> 00:18:52,255
But... how fast
this ship is going!

240
00:18:52,301 --> 00:18:54,132
What devilry is this?

241
00:18:54,181 --> 00:18:56,297
If the ship doesn't
stop, we cannot proceed!

242
00:18:56,341 --> 00:18:58,218
There is no one at the oars!

243
00:18:58,261 --> 00:19:02,095
I'd like to understand what caused
the ship to break its moorings!

244
00:19:02,221 --> 00:19:04,257
This is a ghost ship!

245
00:19:05,221 --> 00:19:07,052
I don't believe it!

246
00:19:07,421 --> 00:19:09,252
Ghost ship?

247
00:19:09,301 --> 00:19:11,417
Oh my god! On the
ship there are evil spirits!

248
00:19:11,461 --> 00:19:13,338
Magnificent! The
soldiers are already afraid!

249
00:19:15,100 --> 00:19:15,716
Your Highness!

250
00:19:15,741 --> 00:19:17,538
It might be useful to you!

251
00:19:17,581 --> 00:19:19,776
- It's a cursed ship!
- Help! Help!

252
00:19:20,261 --> 00:19:22,729
Then it's the ghosts
making the ship move!

253
00:19:22,781 --> 00:19:26,251
That's why no one is at the
oars and the ship goes so fast!

254
00:19:26,301 --> 00:19:28,496
We will defeat the ghosts!

255
00:19:28,541 --> 00:19:31,009
That one is firing the cannon!
I'm getting out of here!

256
00:19:31,661 --> 00:19:34,221
You bunch of cowards!
Chase that ship!

257
00:19:34,261 --> 00:19:36,411
You bunch of cowards,
chase that ship!

258
00:19:43,607 --> 00:19:46,996
Pretend nothing is wrong,
boys. Now we will untie you.

259
00:19:47,021 --> 00:19:49,489
Did you look in here too?

260
00:19:53,501 --> 00:19:57,016
Mr. Ghost, are you in
there? He is not answering!

261
00:19:57,061 --> 00:19:59,097
I'm starting to get scared!

262
00:19:59,140 --> 00:20:01,449
I have never believed in ghosts!

263
00:20:09,741 --> 00:20:12,016
The ghosts have
freed the prisoners!

264
00:20:12,041 --> 00:20:15,133
No, we are the ghosts!
Come on, boys! Forward!

265
00:20:15,181 --> 00:20:18,014
Get the soldiers!
It's over for you!

266
00:20:25,821 --> 00:20:28,335
They want to
slaughter us! Let me in!

267
00:20:28,381 --> 00:20:30,497
There, now we'll let you in!

268
00:20:35,821 --> 00:20:37,136
I stopped in time!

269
00:20:37,160 --> 00:20:38,289
You think so? Go ahead!

270
00:20:38,341 --> 00:20:40,457
No fair! I slipped!

271
00:20:41,861 --> 00:20:44,455
Thank you from the bottom of my heart for
everything that you have done, Your Highness.

272
00:20:44,501 --> 00:20:48,096
I'll tell you that the ghost
prank was quite amusing!

273
00:20:48,140 --> 00:20:51,830
A ship of Grand Duke Duralumin
is following ours!

274
00:20:54,541 --> 00:20:57,260
Tink, be careful!
You might fall!

275
00:20:57,301 --> 00:20:59,181
Okay!

276
00:21:03,621 --> 00:21:06,693
Dolphin friends,
you were so sweet!

277
00:21:17,301 --> 00:21:20,577
Look, the dolphins!
They are the ones pulling the ship!

278
00:21:23,301 --> 00:21:27,419
Row! Soon we will catch up to them!
Push on the oars!

279
00:21:48,461 --> 00:21:50,133
They are going too fast!

280
00:21:50,181 --> 00:21:52,490
We are too fast
for that ship to catch up to us,

281
00:21:52,541 --> 00:21:54,657
so, everyone, listen to me!

282
00:21:54,901 --> 00:21:58,610
We're listening! We're with you!

283
00:21:58,661 --> 00:22:00,652
I'm sure that you
feel the same way I do:

284
00:22:00,701 --> 00:22:03,215
we no longer want to fawn over
those who tyrannize us!

285
00:22:03,261 --> 00:22:05,900
What do you say we go to other
lands to enjoy a free life?

286
00:22:06,101 --> 00:22:14,741
We will never be slaves again!

287
00:22:26,901 --> 00:22:29,756
The prince's ship and the others are leaving.

288
00:22:29,781 --> 00:22:33,501
I'll go say goodbye to them!
Not so fast!

289
00:22:37,341 --> 00:22:40,492
Goodbye, Prince!

290
00:22:45,101 --> 00:22:47,942
You are truly a good Prince,
Sapphire!

291
00:22:47,967 --> 00:22:48,698
Good luck!

292
00:22:49,270 --> 00:22:50,843
Farewell!

293
00:23:04,100 --> 00:23:06,711
Now I must leave too.
Goodbye, Sapphire!

294
00:23:07,661 --> 00:23:09,617
Goodbye to you, Franz.

295
00:23:09,901 --> 00:23:11,450
This is for you.
Take it as a keepsake.

296
00:23:14,421 --> 00:23:16,004
A flower? What does it mean?

297
00:23:16,029 --> 00:23:17,829
Try to guess the secret
language of flowers.

298
00:23:18,990 --> 00:23:19,990
Goodbye!

299
00:23:31,261 --> 00:23:33,138
You say it's secret?

300
00:24:10,101 --> 00:24:13,721
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

301
00:24:13,722 --> 00:24:17,082
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

302
